1
00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:53,740
Who marinated the meat today?

2
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:56,000
The restaurant did. Who else?

3
00:00:56,160 --> 00:00:57,960
This gristle is almost done too.

4
00:00:58,120 --> 00:00:58,720
Come on.

5
00:01:00,280 --> 00:01:01,480
Let me propose a toast.

6
00:01:01,480 --> 00:01:03,680
I really want to thank Mr. Wang this time

7
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:05,600
for keeping Nian'er and me safe.

8
00:01:05,640 --> 00:01:06,280
Thank you.

9
00:01:06,600 --> 00:01:08,060
Don't say that, Sister Lu.

10
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:09,160
Actually,

11
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:11,560
I'm the one who dragged you into this.

12
00:01:11,560 --> 00:01:13,600
Don't talk about being a burden.

13
00:01:13,600 --> 00:01:14,840
Aren't we partners?

14
00:01:14,840 --> 00:01:15,640
That makes us family.

15
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:17,000
And family doesn't stand on ceremony.

16
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:17,640
Come.

17
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:18,080
Come.

18
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,120
Fei is right.

19
00:01:25,120 --> 00:01:26,240
Everyone, eat up.

20
00:01:26,440 --> 00:01:27,280
After the New Year,

21
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:29,840
go to the tutoring classes Mom arranged for you.

22
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:31,800
Pack your things in the next couple of days.

23
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:32,600
Mom.

24
00:01:33,440 --> 00:01:34,960
Don't 'Mom' me.

25
00:01:35,360 --> 00:01:38,000
I checked with the Education Bureau a few days ago.

26
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:39,600
You can go back to high school.

27
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:40,920
I've already contacted the school.

28
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:42,080
Once the semester starts,

29
00:01:42,080 --> 00:01:43,680
I'll get the paperwork done.

30
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:46,700
I'm not going. It's fine helping you at the factory.

31
00:01:53,320 --> 00:01:53,840
What are you looking at?

32
00:01:53,840 --> 00:01:55,200
Looking at them won't help.

33
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:56,660
You must go back to school.

34
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:58,400
Chen Nian,

35
00:01:58,640 --> 00:01:59,840
don't be so stubborn.

36
00:01:59,960 --> 00:02:00,920
You still need

37
00:02:01,160 --> 00:02:02,640
to go to school, right?

38
00:02:07,520 --> 00:02:08,560
Where are you going?

39
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:11,020
We were having a nice meal. Why did she leave?

40
00:02:11,200 --> 00:02:12,280
I'll go check on her.

41
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:14,280
Leave her be. She'll be fine in a bit.

42
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:15,920
Mr. Wang,

43
00:02:16,880 --> 00:02:17,560
Xuefei,

44
00:02:18,079 --> 00:02:18,840
Third Uncle,

45
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:19,600
Ergui.

46
00:02:20,880 --> 00:02:22,120
I'd like to propose a toast to everyone.

47
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:23,720
Thank you for these past few days,

48
00:02:23,720 --> 00:02:25,160
taking care of me and my daughter.

49
00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:26,620
It's the least we could do.

50
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:28,400
Nian'er is still young.

51
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:29,360
She's in her rebellious phase.

52
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:30,480
We all adore her.

53
00:02:30,480 --> 00:02:31,600
She's so lovable.

54
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:32,960
She's not that young.

55
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:34,560
She's not a child anymore.

56
00:02:40,880 --> 00:02:41,400
Ergui,

57
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:43,060
should we go check on Nian'er?

58
00:02:43,440 --> 00:02:44,040
It's fine.

59
00:02:44,040 --> 00:02:44,760
She's just throwing a tantrum.

60
00:02:44,760 --> 00:02:45,640
She'll be fine in a bit.

61
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:47,400
Don't catch a cold. If you do...

62
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:52,800
Third Uncle.

63
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:58,760
Liu Guang.

64
00:02:59,640 --> 00:03:01,240
Have you thought it through?

65
00:03:01,760 --> 00:03:03,600
About the old Korean pines,

66
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:05,400
and

67
00:03:05,920 --> 00:03:07,680
the car bombing 16 years ago.

68
00:03:08,880 --> 00:03:09,800
I can tell you,

69
00:03:11,920 --> 00:03:13,120
but on one condition.

70
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:14,320
Speak.

71
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:19,960
After finding my brother's killer,

72
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:23,160
can you bury his ashes

73
00:03:24,160 --> 00:03:25,680
with my parents?

74
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:28,760
Just over there on the back mountain.

75
00:03:28,760 --> 00:03:29,890
You can apply for it,

76
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:31,800
on the condition that

77
00:03:32,040 --> 00:03:33,480
you confess everything.

78
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:36,360
Zhao Zhiguo,

79
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:38,600
the explosion at the factory...

80
00:03:40,079 --> 00:03:41,000
It was Master Hu

81
00:03:42,200 --> 00:03:44,260
who told us to find that batch of wood.

82
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:46,079
My brother and I

83
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:47,200
tracked down

84
00:03:47,440 --> 00:03:50,040
the truck and the location of the wood.

85
00:03:50,760 --> 00:03:52,690
We just wanted to hijack the goods.

86
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:54,730
We used too much gunpowder,

87
00:03:55,600 --> 00:03:56,680
and there was an accident.

88
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:58,280
Do you know who the victim is?

89
00:03:58,480 --> 00:03:59,880
No one called the police,

90
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:02,040
and no one came looking for us.

91
00:04:02,040 --> 00:04:03,040
We thought

92
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:04,480
God blessed us.

93
00:04:06,600 --> 00:04:07,440
Go on.

94
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:09,480
After this happened,

95
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:12,780
we didn't dare let Master Hu know.

96
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:14,480
This batch of wood...

97
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:16,010
It was too conspicuous.

98
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:19,399
Everyone in Xinchun was looking for it,

99
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:21,329
so we didn't dare to sell it.

100
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,120
A few years ago,

101
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:25,680
we had the idea

102
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:27,930
of shipping this batch of wood out.

103
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:30,760
But a cop got wind of it.

104
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:32,120
After that,

105
00:04:32,520 --> 00:04:34,320
we never dared to touch it again.

106
00:04:35,360 --> 00:04:36,480
Recently,

107
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:38,480
my brother

108
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:41,960
thought about moving this wood again.

109
00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:44,610
Although my brother was a punk,

110
00:04:45,080 --> 00:04:45,960
he was a coward.

111
00:04:46,520 --> 00:04:47,440
He died.

112
00:04:50,880 --> 00:04:52,409
I don't even know who did it.

113
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:55,960
I'm such a bastard.

114
00:04:57,760 --> 00:04:59,020
For this little money,

115
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:02,520
I got my brother killed.

116
00:05:08,280 --> 00:05:10,080
The cop who tracked you back then

117
00:05:11,440 --> 00:05:12,500
was also named Cao.

118
00:05:14,080 --> 00:05:15,340
My police badge number

119
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:17,640
is his.

120
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:24,760
Manman,

121
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:26,520
come with me.

122
00:05:27,320 --> 00:05:28,360
Let's go south,

123
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:29,520
leave Xinchun,

124
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:31,860
and find a place where no one knows us.

125
00:05:32,880 --> 00:05:34,920
Don't worry. I can get the money.

126
00:05:35,960 --> 00:05:37,320
I know you treat me well.

127
00:05:37,880 --> 00:05:38,800
I know it all.

128
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:43,360
Xiaohu.

129
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:46,760
I can't leave.

130
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:49,840
What do you mean you can't leave?

131
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:53,280
Mr. Song is gone.

132
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:55,600
Before he left,

133
00:05:56,320 --> 00:05:58,250
he asked me to do something for him.

134
00:05:58,320 --> 00:06:00,120
Where did Mr. Song go?

135
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:01,680
He passed away.

136
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:06,130
So I have to look after this clinic for him.

137
00:06:14,840 --> 00:06:15,640
Xiaohu.

138
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:17,360
You should go.

139
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,240
Leave Xinchun.

140
00:06:19,520 --> 00:06:20,360
Go as far as you can.

141
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,560
Don't ever come back.

142
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:23,520
Manman.

143
00:06:24,280 --> 00:06:24,880
I...

144
00:06:25,200 --> 00:06:26,460
When you're out there,

145
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:28,040
don't be so hot-tempered.

146
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,970
No one can protect you anymore.

147
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:34,720
Just go.

148
00:07:12,880 --> 00:07:13,560
Manman.

149
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:15,840
I won't forget you.

150
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:18,560
But before I leave,

151
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:20,820
I want to do one more thing.

152
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:23,880
No matter who I'm trying to prove it to,

153
00:07:23,880 --> 00:07:25,410
I just want everyone to know

154
00:07:25,960 --> 00:07:27,820
that I, Teng Xiaohu, am not a jerk.

155
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:30,210
I can also do something decent.

156
00:07:37,440 --> 00:07:38,360
Xiaohu.

157
00:07:47,520 --> 00:07:48,400
Officer Cao.

158
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:49,280
Why are you here?

159
00:07:49,280 --> 00:07:50,010
Director Li.

160
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:51,840
I have something to ask you.

161
00:07:52,159 --> 00:07:52,840
Go ahead.

162
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:57,640
How advanced are our prosthetics now?

163
00:07:57,840 --> 00:07:58,920
If permitted,

164
00:07:58,920 --> 00:07:59,800
or rather,

165
00:07:59,960 --> 00:08:01,320
if we modify it ourselves,

166
00:08:01,320 --> 00:08:03,320
can we stuff some metal items

167
00:08:03,320 --> 00:08:04,760
or metal objects inside?

168
00:08:05,200 --> 00:08:07,040
The materials and technology of our prosthetics

169
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:08,760
are already very mature.

170
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,200
As you said,

171
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:12,800
on top of these basic needs,

172
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:14,040
if the user wants to

173
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:15,480
modify it according to their own needs,

174
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:16,760
it can be done.

175
00:08:17,080 --> 00:08:19,280
For example, extending a certain part.

176
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:21,560
Understood.

177
00:08:22,080 --> 00:08:23,000
Thank you, Director Li.

178
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:24,640
I'll treat you to a meal in a few days.

179
00:08:24,640 --> 00:08:25,160
You...

180
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:30,760
Take this thick sweater.

181
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:35,039
You should also take these reference books.

182
00:08:35,039 --> 00:08:36,799
Aunt Wang said they'll be useful.

183
00:08:36,799 --> 00:08:37,440
Mom.

184
00:08:37,799 --> 00:08:39,200
Do I really have to go?

185
00:08:45,160 --> 00:08:45,890
Officer Cao.

186
00:08:53,040 --> 00:08:53,770
Officer Cao.

187
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:54,520
Give me a moment.

188
00:08:54,520 --> 00:08:56,450
I want to say a few words to my child.

189
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:58,720
I'll wait for you at the door.

190
00:09:03,520 --> 00:09:04,080
Mom.

191
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:05,760
Officer Cao is looking for you.

192
00:09:05,760 --> 00:09:06,520
Just leave the stuff here.

193
00:09:06,520 --> 00:09:07,850
I can clean it up myself.

194
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:08,970
Nian'er.

195
00:09:09,560 --> 00:09:10,820
I'm going out for a bit.

196
00:09:10,880 --> 00:09:13,120
Remember to heat up the food and lock the door tonight.

197
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:13,840
If...

198
00:09:15,680 --> 00:09:16,440
if anything happens,

199
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:17,800
remember to find Wang Hong

200
00:09:17,800 --> 00:09:19,130
and your sister Xuefei.

201
00:09:19,680 --> 00:09:20,200
Mom.

202
00:09:20,520 --> 00:09:22,120
What's wrong with you today?

203
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:25,890
Take good care of yourself.

204
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:29,240
I know. I'm not a kid.

205
00:09:34,040 --> 00:09:35,160
In my heart,

206
00:09:36,280 --> 00:09:37,540
you are always a child.

207
00:09:39,280 --> 00:09:41,010
I will always love you the most.

208
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:42,920
So cheesy.

209
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:44,480
Go ahead.

210
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:45,440
I got it.

211
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:50,650
Officer Cao is waiting for you.

212
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,160
Thank you.

213
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:22,080
We found a better prosthetic limb

214
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:24,040
at your house.

215
00:10:24,440 --> 00:10:25,770
Why didn't you put it on?

216
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:26,480
The new one,

217
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:27,160
I tried it.

218
00:10:27,160 --> 00:10:28,240
The new one,

219
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:29,240
I'm not used to it.

220
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:33,860
This old one has been with me the longest.

221
00:10:35,680 --> 00:10:37,440
It helped me learn to eat

222
00:10:37,560 --> 00:10:38,820
and work with one hand.

223
00:10:39,640 --> 00:10:41,370
It helped me raise my daughter.

224
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:45,040
When Teng Xiaohu took me and my daughter away,

225
00:10:45,880 --> 00:10:46,880
I realized

226
00:10:48,160 --> 00:10:49,520
I had nothing but it.

227
00:10:51,040 --> 00:10:52,600
It's a part of my body,

228
00:10:54,400 --> 00:10:55,880
and the only weapon

229
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:58,280
I could grasp

230
00:11:02,040 --> 00:11:03,370
to protect my daughter.

231
00:11:05,440 --> 00:11:09,040
You knew all along that he was the one who bombed the car back then.

232
00:11:13,520 --> 00:11:14,650
You killed Liu Ming,

233
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:18,360
didn't you?

234
00:11:39,560 --> 00:11:40,880
Sixteen years ago,

235
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:45,200
my husband and I

236
00:11:45,360 --> 00:11:46,620
received a commission

237
00:11:47,280 --> 00:11:48,740
to transport some timber.

238
00:11:49,160 --> 00:11:50,960
The price offered was very high.

239
00:11:51,080 --> 00:11:54,280
But it didn't take long for me to realize something was wrong.

240
00:11:54,280 --> 00:11:55,410
That batch of timber

241
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:58,120
belonged to Zhao Zhiguo.

242
00:12:00,400 --> 00:12:02,730
I tried to persuade my husband many times.

243
00:12:03,160 --> 00:12:05,040
Zhao Zhiguo treated our family well.

244
00:12:05,040 --> 00:12:06,570
Right after he passed away,

245
00:12:07,440 --> 00:12:09,440
someone set their eyes on his goods.

246
00:12:10,880 --> 00:12:13,480
We couldn't do something so shady.

247
00:12:16,600 --> 00:12:17,400
But,

248
00:12:20,280 --> 00:12:21,080
but...

249
00:12:21,440 --> 00:12:22,440
you said...

250
00:12:24,040 --> 00:12:26,170
you said our daughter was still young.

251
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:29,780
The pressure of life was just too overwhelming.

252
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:31,520
So I gritted my teeth

253
00:12:31,720 --> 00:12:32,980
and convinced myself.

254
00:12:33,160 --> 00:12:35,020
The dead cannot come back to life.

255
00:12:35,920 --> 00:12:37,400
I was just a transporter,

256
00:12:37,880 --> 00:12:39,560
only earning the freight fee.

257
00:12:40,840 --> 00:12:41,520
So,

258
00:12:42,560 --> 00:12:43,490
everything else

259
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:46,900
had absolutely nothing to do with me.

260
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:55,000
People

261
00:12:55,320 --> 00:12:57,580
shouldn't go against their conscience.

262
00:12:58,240 --> 00:13:00,100
This is my family's retribution.

263
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:03,240
I didn't dare to call the police.

264
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:06,060
My husband was hurt worse than me.

265
00:13:07,520 --> 00:13:08,650
He hung on by a thread

266
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:10,130
for three or four years.

267
00:13:14,080 --> 00:13:15,880
In the end, he still passed away.

268
00:13:18,880 --> 00:13:20,480
I could only rely on myself

269
00:13:21,120 --> 00:13:22,580
to investigate the clues.

270
00:13:26,840 --> 00:13:27,920
A few months ago,

271
00:13:28,800 --> 00:13:31,320
I finally found clues from sixteen years ago

272
00:13:31,320 --> 00:13:33,800
about that batch of old Korean pines.

273
00:13:35,440 --> 00:13:36,500
We arranged to meet

274
00:13:36,880 --> 00:13:38,240
at the Lincheng Hotel.

275
00:14:19,400 --> 00:14:20,040
Boss.

276
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:24,780
I can sell this wood to you at a cheaper price.

277
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:38,160
Do you remember the car bombing sixteen years ago?

278
00:14:39,880 --> 00:14:40,640
I don't know.

279
00:14:41,400 --> 00:14:43,200
Do you still remember Chen Lu?

280
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:45,250
I don't know her.

281
00:14:51,440 --> 00:14:52,120
I know you.

282
00:14:52,680 --> 00:14:53,440
You do?

283
00:14:53,520 --> 00:14:55,920
Then isn't this a reunion after a long time?

284
00:15:33,840 --> 00:15:34,640
Xin Kan.

285
00:15:34,640 --> 00:15:36,900
I have never stood on the side of justice.

286
00:15:38,520 --> 00:15:39,720
I can only avenge this

287
00:15:40,920 --> 00:15:41,920
myself.

288
00:15:45,280 --> 00:15:47,140
I brought all of this upon myself.

289
00:15:51,640 --> 00:15:52,920
I did the killing.

290
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:57,000
I admit it.
